Package: swatplusEditoR
Type: Package
Title: R Interface for SWAT+ Hydrological Model
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2025-01-01
Authors@R: c(
    person("SWAT+ Editor", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "swatplus@example.com")
  )
Description: An R package that replicates the functionality of the SWAT+
    Editor Python API (src/api) and adds watershed delineation capabilities.
    Provides tools to delineate watersheds from a DEM using TauDEM (via the
    'traudem' package) — equivalent to what QSWAT+ (<https://github.com/swat-model/QSWATPlus>)
    does in a desktop workflow, but without requiring QGIS or QSWAT+. Also
    provides tools to read shapefiles and raster data, write to the dedicated
    SWAT+ SQLite project database, import GIS data, import weather data, write
    SWAT+ input files, run the SWAT+ model, and read simulation output. This
    package serves as an R-native alternative to the Python-based SWAT+ Editor
    backend combined with QSWAT+ for the full end-to-end workflow.
